   "value": 1.5,
   "tolerance": {
    "kind": "absolute",
    "amount": 0.005
   }
  },
  "explanation": "$\\mathrm{E}(X) = 0(0.1) + 1(0.45) + 2(0.3) + 3(0.15) = 0.45 + 0.6 + 0.45 = 1.5$. (0.25 is the mean of the four probabilities, which is always $\\frac{1}{4}$.)",
  "workedSolution": "1. $\\mathrm{E}(X) = 0(0.1) + 1(0.45) + 2(0.3) + 3(0.15) = 0.45 + 0.6 + 0.45 = 1.5$. (0.25 is the mean of the four probabilities, which is always $\\frac{1}{4}$.)",
